    "tagLine": "Discover Luxury Living in the Heart of Castleknock",
    "location": "Prime Location \r\n\r\nBalroy Hall is situated in the vibrant community of Castleknock, offering a perfect blend of urban convenience and suburban tranquility. Discover the local attractions and amenities that make Castleknock a sought-after location: \r\n\r\nLocal Places of Interest: \r\n\r\nPhoenix Park: One of Europe's largest enclosed parks, perfect for picnics, jogging, and outdoor activities. Home to the Dublin Zoo, Aras un Uachtarain and countless historical landlmarks. \r\n\r\nFarmleigh House: A stunning historic estate offering guided tours, beautiful gardens, art exhibitions and cultural events. \r\n\r\nCastleknock Golf Club: Enjoy a round of golf at this prestigious 18-hole course set in picturesque surroundings. Also close to Luttrellstown Castle Golf and Country Club. \r\n\r\nNearby Amenities: \r\n\r\nShopping and Dining: Explore an array of shops, cafes, and restaurants in Castleknock Village and nearby Blanchardstown Centre. \r\n\r\nExcellent Schools: A selection of top-rated primary and secondary schools within easy reach. \r\n\r\nConvenient Transportation: Excellent transport links including the Castleknock train station, multiple bus routes, and easy access to the M50 motorway. \r\n\r\nHealthcare: Nearby to healthcare facilities including Connolly Hospital Blanchardstown and various local clinics. \r\n\r\nSchools: Proximity to excellent educational institutions including Castleknock College, Mount Sackville Secondary School and several primary schools."
